# AINav Control Plane — Cursor project rules

## Identity
- Company: AINav, Inc.
- Public edge: AINav.Institute
- Product: AINav Control Plane
- Job C only: effect authority (dual admit + DecisionRecords) before privileged SoR writes
- Not Job A inventory; not Job B IdP replacement; complement Agent 365 / Okta / Zenity

## Naming
- Never lead with Aether as a product brand
- SOW / contracts: AINav, Inc.
- Pin / verify: AINav.Institute

## Pin edge (Azure)
- Deploy static tree: mothership/www → Azure Static Web Apps
- Script: mothership/azure/deploy-swa.sh
- CI: .github/workflows/azure-static-web-apps.yml (secret AZURE_STATIC_WEB_APPS_API_TOKEN)
- LIVE_PIN_OK: https://ainav.institute/health.json is JSON with policy_digest (not Squarespace HTML)
- DNS: Cloudflare already resolves the domain; remove Squarespace targets; point at SWA per Azure custom-domain instructions
- See docs/DNS_PROPAGATION_TROUBLESHOOTING.md and docs/DO_THESE_NOW.md

## Admit plane
- Dual: named distinct principals, action_hash triple bind, single-use, fail-closed
- Single-host atomic via AdmitLock; multi-host = Postgres/Redis later — not claimed until wired
- Website serves the pin — does not admit

## Commercial
- Land: FIRST_OFFER L1 $28/35/40k fixtures-first
- Attach: P-ADM $40–60k/yr within ~90 days of green L1
- No fail-open discounts; no inventory SKUs

## Success equation
SUCCESS = LIVE_PIN_OK × proof day × signed L1 FIRST_OFFER
